        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) Subject to subsection 28(1) and except as may be approved by the Minister on the recommendation of the Bank, no prescribed institution shall have an exposure to a single counterparty, whether in relation to its own funds or any trust fund it manages under section 43, which exceeds the limit as may be specified by the Bank.”;"
      }
