        "@value": "by substituting for the definition of “credit facility” the following definition: ‘ “financing facility” means— (a) an advance, loan or other facility, in whatever form or by whatever name called, by which the customer has access, directly or indirectly, to the funds of the prescribed institution and includes a financing facility which is made in accordance with Shariah; and (b) the giving of a guarantee, credit insurance or takaful cover in relation to a financing facility;’;"
      }
    },
