        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “Chief Executive Officer” the following definition: ‘ “computer” has the same meaning as in the Evidence Act 1950;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_3__para_a__subpara_viii",
