        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “controller” the following definition: ‘ “chairman”, in relation to a prescribed institution, means chairman of the board of directors;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_3__para_a__subpara_xiv",
