      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3), by substituting for the words “rights, protection and indemnity” the words “rights, privileges, protection, immunities and indemnities”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_77__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_77",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (4) the following subsection: “(4) An investigating officer, in exercising his powers and performing his functions, shall be subject to and comply with the directions, controls, instructions, conditions, restrictions or limitations as may be specified by the Bank, orally or in writing, either generally, or in any particular case or circumstance.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_77__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_77",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection: “(5) An investigating officer conducting any examination of any person under this Act shall have the power to administer an oath or affirmation to the person who is being examined.”. New section 88a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_78",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "78",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 88 the following section: “Governor to have powers and functions of investigating officer 88a. The Governor shall have all the powers and functions of an investigating officer.”. Amendment of section 89"
      }
    },
    {
