        "@value": "in paragraph (a), by deleting the words “belonging to or in possession or control of the prescribed institution or its holding company, subsidiary, or employee”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_79__para_a__subpara_ii",
