      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_80__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the word “him” the words “, within the time specified by such officer,”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_80__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_80__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “report or document” the words “report, document, apparatus, equipment, machinery, computer, computer output, system, data, books, information, article or thing which may assist in the investigation into the offence or breach”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_80__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_80",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3) Any person who contravenes subsection (2) commits an offence and shall on conviction be liable to imprisonment for a term not exceeding eight years or to a fine not exceeding twenty-five million ringgit or to both.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_80__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_80",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (8), by substituting for the words “to a fine not exceeding one million ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both and, in the case of a continuing offence, to a further fine not exceeding one thousand ringgit, for each day during which the offence continues after conviction” the words “to imprisonment for a term not exceeding eight years or to a fine not exceeding twenty-five million ringgit or to both”. Amendment of section 91"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_81",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "81",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 91 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “report or document” wherever appearing the words “report, document, apparatus, equipment, machinery, computer, computer output, system, data, books, information, article or thing”. Amendment of section 92"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_82",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "82",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_82__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_82__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 92 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_82__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_82",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) An investigating officer searching a person under paragraph 89(1)(e) may, subject to the provisions of the Criminal Procedure Code [Act 593], detain such person as may be necessary to have the search carried out, and may remove him in custody to such place as may be necessary to facilitate such search.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_82__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_82",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) Any search of a person conducted under this Part shall be in accordance with the provisions in the Criminal Procedure Code.”. Amendment of section 93"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@/~cl_83",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "83",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 93 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “a fine not exceeding three million ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both and, in the case of a continuing offence, to a further fine not exceeding three thousand ringgit for each day during which the offence continues after conviction” the words “imprisonment for a term not exceeding eight years or to a fine not exceeding twenty-five million ringgit or to both”. Amendment of section 94"
      }
