        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 108 the following section: “Imprisonment 108a. Where the penalty of imprisonment has been provided for an offence under this Act, such penalty shall not apply to a body corporate convicted of the offence.”. Amendment of section 113"
      }
